{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Colimit.DirectLimit"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.directedSystem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.directedSystem","kind":"instance","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L76-L84","doc":"The Hecke tower is a directed system over `ℕ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_σ","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L63-L74","doc":"The iterated inclusion is the identity on generator *indices*: `σ_m` at level\n`i` goes to `σ_m` at level `j`.  One step is `heckeIncl_σ` (`σ_i ↦ σ_{i.castSucc}`);\nthis is the `Nat.le_induction` iterate, and it is what lets a generator be read at\nany level of the tower above the one it first appears in. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_trans","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L52-L61","doc":"**Composition.** Induction on the upper index, via `Nat.le_induction`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_succ","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L47-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE_self","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L43-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeDirectedSystem.heckeInclLE","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeDirectedSystem.lean#L37-L41","doc":"The iterated Hecke inclusion `H_i →ₐ H_j` for `i ≤ j`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}